{"id":"n71028-1-3","stage":3,"title":"분명 · 肯定地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71028-1-3-1","ko":"내가 분명 책상에다 안경을 뒀는데 어디 갔지?","zh":"我明明把眼镜放在桌子上了，它去哪儿了啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"분명","meaning":"肯定地，分明地，明明白白地","explanation":"분명：肯定地，分明地，明明白白地","readings":[{"term":"분명","audio":"/audio/e2da600620a7fd1a316e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71028","senseId":"1","lemma":"분명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분명","audio":"/audio/e2da600620a7fd1a316e.mp3"}},{"text":"책상에다","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌；에다：表示放置、添加或作用的位置；相当于强调的 에。","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","senseId":"1","lemma":"책상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책상에다","audio":"/audio/8175fcfbbe109dec3994.mp3"}},{"text":"안경을","meaning":"眼镜","explanation":"안경：眼镜；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"안경","audio":"/audio/7c40f615a28bcb4a9828.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31484","senseId":"1","lemma":"안경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안경을","audio":"/audio/188ed0896867b6814760.mp3"}},{"text":"뒀는데","meaning":"搁，放置，摆放","explanation":"두다：搁，放置，摆放；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒀는데","audio":"/audio/2b763f85e39018d43480.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"갔지?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"17","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔지","audio":"/audio/831935d77a2231fd82f8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"e2da600620a7fd1a","term":"분명","zh":"肯定地，分明地，明明白白地","audio":"/audio/e2da600620a7fd1a316e.mp3","entryId":"71028","definition":"没有差错，确定地。","pronunciation":["분명"]},{"id":"e2d1cb559455849b","term":"책상","zh":"书桌","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3","entryId":"72039","definition":"供阅读或书写或办公用的桌子。","pronunciation":["책쌍"]},{"id":"7c40f615a28bcb4a","term":"안경","zh":"眼镜","audio":"/audio/7c40f615a28bcb4a9828.mp3","entryId":"31484","definition":"为了保护眼睛或矫正视力而戴在眼睛上的东西。","pronunciation":["안ː경"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"搁，放置，摆放","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"放在某处。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"消失不见。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e1cb219c6e3d85a066ca.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71028-1-3-2","ko":"책상에 안경 둔 거 정말 확실한 거야?","zh":"你确定眼镜真的放在桌子上了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"책상에","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","senseId":"1","lemma":"책상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책상에","audio":"/audio/857c9dcfc1b6ee935b30.mp3"}},{"text":"안경","meaning":"眼镜","explanation":"안경：眼镜","readings":[{"term":"안경","audio":"/audio/7c40f615a28bcb4a9828.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31484","senseId":"1","lemma":"안경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안경","audio":"/audio/7c40f615a28bcb4a9828.mp3"}},{"text":"둔","meaning":"撇下，丢下，落","explanation":"두다：撇下，丢下，落；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"3","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둔","audio":"/audio/116fbf2f245c5cf6c9f8.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"확실한","meaning":"确实，准确，确定","explanation":"확실하다：确实，准确，确定；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"확실하다","audio":"/audio/0c443e91aeb77d43cfe4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73234","senseId":"1","lemma":"확실하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"확실한","audio":"/audio/fa164cc7bd186a8d21b1.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e2d1cb559455849b","term":"책상","zh":"书桌","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3","entryId":"72039","definition":"供阅读或书写或办公用的桌子。","pronunciation":["책쌍"]},{"id":"7c40f615a28bcb4a","term":"안경","zh":"眼镜","audio":"/audio/7c40f615a28bcb4a9828.mp3","entryId":"31484","definition":"为了保护眼睛或矫正视力而戴在眼睛上的东西。","pronunciation":["안ː경"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"撇下，丢下，落","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"不带走，遗留或丢弃。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。；表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"0c443e91aeb77d43","term":"확실하다","zh":"确实，准确，确定","audio":"/audio/0c443e91aeb77d43cfe4.mp3","entryId":"73234","definition":"与实际完全一样，或一定是那样。","pronunciation":["확씰하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6722b73a08eefaa2b309.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.0,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71028","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":108,"sequenceScore":2.8267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你确定眼镜真的放在桌子上了吗？","你对我有什么不满吗？为什么不接我的电话？","我明明把眼镜放在桌子上了，它去哪儿了啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你确定眼镜真的放在桌子上了吗？","我明明把眼镜放在桌子上了，它去哪儿了啊？","你对我有什么不满吗？为什么不接我的电话？"],"answer":0}]}
